oadHash`、Permission revision，并写 canonical Permission 决议与 command journal；\n2. 若 live Broker 中仍有 waiter，再通知它解除 Tool effect；\n3. Core 收到通知时允许“canonical 已以相同 outcome/revision 提交”的幂等 no-op；\n4. Host 重启后即使 waiter 消失，canonical 决议仍供 Run recovery 使用。\n\nAbort 同理：HostStore 原子提交 command journal + Run `CANCELLING`，然后才请求取消 live effect。这样网络重试不会依赖当前 Run 是否还 active。将按这个边界实现，不把 broker map 持久化。"},{"id":"tool-call-call_up013ElICc77iD7LwVzsdHjO","kind":"toolCall","title":"grep | head -80 \"class State|record Journal|class Journal|record PreparedProjection\" E:\\Projects\\Code\\AI\\Ji\\ji-java\\applications\\ji-host-core\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\host\\MemoryHostStore.java","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_up013ElICc77iD7LwVzsdHjO","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","seq":6721,"startedSeq":6706,"endedSeq":6721,"timestamp":"1788623121Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Grep","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_L5wNClRo0jMt94cdLjrGKOYH","kind":"toolCall","title":"Read ji-java\\adapters\\ji-host-sqlite\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\host\\sqlite\\SqliteHostStorePersistence.java (35 - 164)","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_L5wNClRo0jMt94cdLjrGKOYH","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","seq":6714,"startedSeq":6709,"endedSeq":6714,"timestamp":"1788623121Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Read","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_0j5AzqJrZZ82MDuz4f5X9tm5","kind":"toolCall","title":"Read ji-java\\applications\\ji-host-core\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\host\\MemoryHostStore.java (730 - 869)","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_0j5AzqJrZZ82MDuz4f5X9tm5","sessionId":"a4b4e6f4-8ab1-40bb-9a88-ff8aa798e2cc","seq":6711,"startedSeq":6710,"endedSeq":6711,"timestamp":"1788623121Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Read","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-c